{
    "title": "Minnesota Vikings",
    "description": "Welcome to the official mobile app of the\r\nMinnesota Vikings!\r\nFeaturing all the best content from the\r\nVikings Entertainment Network, including\r\nthe latest articles, videos, photos, and\r\npodcasts about the Minnesota Vikings.\r\nDownload and view your tickets to a\r\ngame, see gameday offers, get directions\r\nand parking to the stadium and more.\r\nTurn on push notifications to be the first\r\nto get breaking news about the team and\r\nchoose what topics you would like to be\r\nalerted about when the next segment\r\ndrops.\r\nFeatures include:\r\n\u2022 Personalize your home screen icons by\r\nselecting which ones you want to feature\r\nand have direct access to.\r\n\u2022 News: Real-time breaking news from\r\nthe Vikings, previews of upcoming\r\nmatchups, postgame recaps and in-\r\ndepth player features\r\n\u2022 Videos: Live shows, press conferences,\r\nmic\u2019d up and all access segments\r\n\u2022 Photos: View game action, practice,\r\ntravel photos and more captured by team\r\nphotographers\r\n\u2022 Audio: Listen to the latest episodes\r\nfrom the Minnesota Vikings Podcast\r\nNetwork\r\n\u2022 Push notifications: From breaking news\r\nto important gameday information,\r\nmanage your push notification\r\npreference to be alerted about topics that\r\ninterest you\r\n\u2022 Stats: Real-time stats and scores from\r\nthe official NFL stats engine, head-to-\r\nhead stats of the matchup, player stats,\r\ndrive-by-drive stats and box score\r\n\u2022 Standings: Division and conference\r\nstandings\r\n\u2022 Depth chart: Player rankings of offense,\r\ndefense and special teams\r\n\u2022 Schedule: See who the Vikings battle\r\nnext and purchase tickets to an\r\nupcoming game at U.S. Bank Stadium\r\nIn-Stadium Features:\r\n\u2022 Download and manage your Vikings\r\ntickets\r\n\u2022 Push notifications: Turn on alerts and\r\nreceive helpful information and\r\nexclusive offers as a ticket holder\r\n\u2022 Get directions to the stadium, find\r\nparking and metro transit details\r\n\u2022 See helpful stadium information or\r\nreport an issue\r\n\u2022 Ask Vik: Get all your gameday\r\nquestions answered with the help of the\r\n\u2022 Vikings Bot",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to the official mobile app of the<br>Minnesota Vikings!<br>Featuring all the best content from the<br>Vikings Entertainment Network, including<br>the latest articles, videos, photos, and<br>podcasts about the Minnesota Vikings.<br>Download and view your tickets to a<br>game, see gameday offers, get directions<br>and parking to the stadium and more.<br>Turn on push notifications to be the first<br>to get breaking news about the team and<br>choose what topics you would like to be<br>alerted about when the next segment<br>drops.<br>Features include:<br>\u2022 Personalize your home screen icons by<br>selecting which ones you want to feature<br>and have direct access to.<br>\u2022 News: Real-time breaking news from<br>the Vikings, previews of upcoming<br>matchups, postgame recaps and in-<br>depth player features<br>\u2022 Videos: Live shows, press conferences,<br>mic\u2019d up and all access segments<br>\u2022 Photos: View game action, practice,<br>travel photos and more captured by team<br>photographers<br>\u2022 Audio: Listen to the latest episodes<br>from the Minnesota Vikings Podcast<br>Network<br>\u2022 Push notifications: From breaking news<br>to important gameday information,<br>manage your push notification<br>preference to be alerted about topics that<br>interest you<br>\u2022 Stats: Real-time stats and scores from<br>the official NFL stats engine, head-to-<br>head stats of the matchup, player stats,<br>drive-by-drive stats and box score<br>\u2022 Standings: Division and conference<br>standings<br>\u2022 Depth chart: Player rankings of offense,<br>defense and special teams<br>\u2022 Schedule: See who the Vikings battle<br>next and purchase tickets to an<br>upcoming game at U.S. Bank Stadium<br>In-Stadium Features:<br>\u2022 Download and manage your Vikings<br>tickets<br>\u2022 Push notifications: Turn on alerts and<br>receive helpful information and<br>exclusive offers as a ticket holder<br>\u2022 Get directions to the stadium, fi